Cisco Networking Academy – Intro to Cybersecurity

## Key points
- Identity theft = criminals using your personal data (name, ID numbers, bank details) to pose as you
- Data is stolen via phishing, data breaches, weak passwords

## In my own words
Even small details like birthdate plus phone number can be combined to impersonate someone in digital world.

## How to protect myself
- Unique passwords + a password manager
- Turn on two-factor authentication
- Don't overshare on social media
